cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Data, code and supplemental material for Source Grounding Verifies Retrieval and Not Interpretation in Automated Extraction from Construction Tender Documents"
version: "2.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-04"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, evaluation harness, hand-verified labels and analysis
  scripts for a source-grounded hybrid workflow that extracts decision-critical
  information from Spanish public works tender specifications. Every surfaced value
  must be locatable in the source text before it is shown. This release adds the
  multi-country study of numeric representation failure, with the corpus definition,
  the measurement scripts and their outputs, the console transcripts of the campaigns
  that precede the canonical one, and the supplemental document of the article.
